{"id":"cb7b0e847fbe68e0","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-prop-forcing-definition-recursive.md","title":"Forcing Definition Recursive","display":"prop-forcing-definition-recursive — Forcing Definition Recursive","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-forcing-definition-recursive","aliases":["58-prop-forcing-definition-recursive"],"display":"prop-forcing-definition-recursive — Forcing Definition Recursive","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-forcing-definition-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-forcing-definition-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-forcing-definition-recursive — Forcing Definition Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,\\leq_P)\">\\((P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (迫使偏序, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (偏序谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\in P\">\\(p \\in P\\)</span> (条件)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-名字, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}\\)</span> (迫使名字谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_P\">\\(\\Vdash_P\\)</span> (按名字秩递归定义的迫使关系)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau\">\\(\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau\\)</span> (名字成员对)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}definition\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land p\\in P\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\left[p\\Vdash_P\\sigma\\in\\tau\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;\\exists\\rho,s\\;\n(\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau\\land r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Ps\\land r\\Vdash_P\\sigma=\\rho)\\Bigr)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}definition\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land p\\in P\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\left[p\\Vdash_P\\sigma\\in\\tau\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;\\exists\\rho,s\\;\n(\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau\\land r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Ps\\land r\\Vdash_P\\sigma=\\rho)\\Bigr)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The forcing relation is defined recursively on the complexity of formulas.</li>\n<li>该成员关系子句只调用更低名字秩上的等号迫使关系，从而形成对名字秩的良基递归；原式对同一原子式自调用，不能作为定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(P,\\leq_P)$ (迫使偏序, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"ec28b62254928d73","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau$ ($P$-名字, see [[../batch07/58-df-name.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"p \\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Name}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}definition\\text{-}recursive} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land p\\in P\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\sigma,P)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\tau,P)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\left[p\\Vdash_P\\sigma\\in\\tau\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in P\\;\\Bigl(q\\leq_Pp\\to\\exists r\\in P\\;\\exists\\rho,s\\;\n(\\langle\\rho,s\\rangle\\in\\tau\\land r\\leq_Pq\\land r\\leq_Ps\\land r\\Vdash_P\\sigma=\\rho)\\Bigr)\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1454,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3960","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-prop-forcing-definition-recursive.md|58-prop-forcing-definition-recursive]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","ec28b62254928d73"]}